# recursive interpolation not allowed

Zvabuda nyora: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Chirongwa chimiro-chebasa: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), mutsara-mutsva.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Zvabuda nyora: a, mutsara-mutsva.


